  rui-ui/src/commonMain/kotlin/rui/theme/RuiShape.kt
    - Continuous-corner ("squircle") shape algorithm adapted from miuix's
      miuix-squircle module (Path.addSquircleRect).
    - Modified: re-exposed as a Compose Shape (SmoothCornerShape) integrated
      with Rui's theme tokens instead of miuix's modifier API.

  rui-ui/src/commonMain/kotlin/rui/foundation/BlurBackdrop.kt
    - Backdrop-capture mechanism (GraphicsLayer recording + coordinates
      translation) adapted from miuix's miuix-blur module
      (LayerBackdrop/LayerBackdropModifier).
    - Modified: heavily reduced - blur applies through Compose's
      cross-platform BlurEffect instead of miuix's AGSL/SkSL runtime-shader
      pipeline; no progressive blur, noise dither or highlights.

